      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUTTERNUT QUEEN (8) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from eight starts. Was out of the placings last time (19.28) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing sixth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Looks well placed and should feature. CHIP KICK (4) broke a string of placings finishing in the money four on end before a last start eighth (22.80) at Q Lakeside. Form at this distance is sound. Comes through a solid form race last start. Likely to be about the mark. ACES ROSE (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (17.45) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can improve sharply here. STRIKING BEACH (6) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
